{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgERn1r3nxc33pevdAquF", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "**答案：约 309 米。**\n\nСоборное уложение 1649 年的原本是一卷长约 309 米的“столбец”（卷轴）。它由 959 条窄纸条粘接而成，正文写在正面，背面是签名。原件现藏于俄罗斯国家古代文献档案馆（РГАДА），装在一个镀金的“ковчег”匣子里。\n\n“309 米”这个数字在搜索结果里只有白俄罗斯国家图书馆（nlb.by）一个来源，我没有在其他来源里核实到。959 条纸条的说法另有两个来源。\n\n共搜索 2 次。\n\n依据网址：\n- [nlb.by：Соборное уложение 的介绍（309 米、背面签名、存于 РГАДА）](https://www.nlb.by/en/events/332293/)\n- [dic.academic.ru：СОБОРНОЕ УЛОЖЕНИЕ 1649 ГОДА（959 条纸条）](https://dic.academic.ru/dic.nsf/russian_history/11379/%D0%A1%D0%9E%D0%91%D0%9E%D0%A0%D0%9D%D0%9E%D0%95)\n- [studfile.net（959 条纸条）](https://studfile.net/preview/3113601/)"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 1072, "cache_read_input_tokens": 5571, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 1072}, "output_tokens": 3, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-21T00:22:36.463Z", "request_id": "req_011CgERn1bfAEBYbxof7gqzf"}
